{"id":"CVE-2016-7438","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"mitre","published":"2016-12-13T16:00:00.000Z","updated":"2024-08-06T01:57:47.643Z","description":"The C software implementation of ECC in wolfSSL (formerly CyaSSL) before 3.9.10 makes it easier for local users to discover RSA keys by leveraging cache-bank hit differences.","cwe":["n/a"],"metrics":[],"affected":[{"vendor":"n/a","product":"n/a","versions":["affected n/a"]}],"references":[{"url":"https://wolfssl.com/wolfSSL/Blog/Entries/2016/9/26_wolfSSL_3.9.10_Vulnerability_Fixes.html","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/95066","tags":["vdb-entry","x_refsource_BID"],"name":"95066"}],"vendors":["crypto-libs"]}
